<title>UK: Hewden-Stuart names group managing director.</title>
<headline>Hewden-Stuart names group managing director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glasgow-based construction equipment group Hewden-Stuart Plc said on Monday that it had appointed Alistair Napier to the new position of group managing director with effect from March.</p>
<p>Napier was most recently chief operating officer of the food packaging business of Lawson Mardon.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
